@startuml

actor ":TippHub Betreiber" as thb
participant ":System" as system

activate thb
thb -> system: öffne Userverwaltung
rnote right #lightgreen: OP1(UC-1)
deactivate thb
activate system
system --> thb : Anzeige der Userliste
rnote left #lightgreen: OP2(UC-2)
activate thb
thb -> system : wähle und sperre User
rnote right #lightgreen: OP3(UC-2)
system --> thb : Bestätigung der Sperrung
rnote left #lightgreen: OP4(UC-2)
deactivate thb
